186559069 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186559080 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186559180 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186559285 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186559426 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186559069 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559767 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f814dc0c-188f-574f-b854-176c72a87e74" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559812 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186559717 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559812 #edb/ref 1069 "q-51471" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559812 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559812 #edb/ref 1071 "Solve the equation $\\frac{2}{3x+12}=\\frac{2}{x+4}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559812 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "600419ab-eff5-5dfa-9145-b6a621ba7867" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559812 #edb/ref 1074 "First, note that $x=-4$ cannot be a solution since division by $0$ is undefined. \n\nTo solve the equation, we first apply cross-multiplication:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3x+12} & =\\frac{2}{x+4} \\\\ 2\\cdot (x+4) & =(3x+12)\\cdot 2 \\\\ 2x+8 & =6x+24\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles, as usual:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+8 & =6x+24 \\\\ 2x+8-24 & =6x+24-24 \\\\ 2x-16 & =6x \\\\ 2x-16-2x & =6x-2x \\\\ -16 & =4x \\\\ \\frac{-16}{4} & =\\frac{4x}{4} \\\\ -4 & =x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $x=-4$ cannot be a solution, the equation has no solutions." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559882 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186559735 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559882 #edb/ref 1069 "q-102818" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559882 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559882 #edb/ref 1071 "Solve the equation $\\frac{1}{x-1}=\\frac{2}{x+3}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559882 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f03fefa6-3a2e-5378-840e-6b0b6beb7bc1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559882 #edb/ref 1074 "First, note that $x=-3$ and $x=1$ cannot be solutions since division by $0$ is undefined.\n\nTo solve the equation, we first apply cross-multiplication:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{x-1} & =\\frac{2}{x+3} \\\\ 1\\cdot (x+3) & =(x-1)\\cdot 2 \\\\ x+3 & =2x-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles, as usual:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+3 & =2x-2 \\\\ x+3-x & =2x-2-x \\\\ 3 & =x-2 \\\\ 3+2 & =x-2+2 \\\\ 5 & =x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $x=5$ is different from $x=-3$ and $x=1,$ we can accept it as a solution. Thus, the solution is $x=5.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559887 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186559767 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559887 #edb/ref 1069 "q-47794" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559887 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559887 #edb/ref 1071 "Solve the equation $\\frac{9}{6x-3}=\\frac{2}{3x+1}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559887 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f7ee9ca4-a3f0-5a8a-a26b-4c46c8822ae6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559887 #edb/ref 1074 "First, note that $x=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $x=-\\frac{1}{3}$ cannot be solutions since division by $0$ is undefined. \n\nTo solve the equation, we first apply cross-multiplication:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{9}{6x-3} & =\\frac{2}{3x+1} \\\\ 9\\cdot (3x+1) & =(6x-3)\\cdot 2 \\\\ 27x+9 & =12x-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles, as usual:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}27x+9 & =12x-6 \\\\ 27x+9-12x & =12x-6-12x \\\\ 15x+9 & =-6 \\\\ 15x+9-9 & =-6-9 \\\\ 15x & =-15 \\\\ \\frac{15x}{15} & =\\frac{-15}{15} \\\\ x & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince  $x=-1$ is different from $x=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $x=-\\frac{1}{3},$ we can accept it as a solution.\nThus, the solution is $x=-1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559898 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "06eb6fa1-dfb2-5b2c-acc7-dce9cf39f5b3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559898 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186559882 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559930 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559940 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559930 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "544b0bbe-7699-51f8-ab7e-6267f3303aae" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559930 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186559887 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559940 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559898 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559940 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6e6e733b-eaf0-5101-bc15-75bd30fffd8b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559940 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186559812 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
